<title>UK: Hammerson buys into Reading shop project.</title>
<headline>Hammerson buys into Reading shop project.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development group Hammerson Plc said on Wednesday it had conditionally agreed to buy BICC Development's interest in the proposed Oracle Shopping Centre in Reading, southern England.</p>
<p>The proposed shopping centre covers 65,000 square metres and includes two department stores and 100 shop units.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
